astBallMaster_Screenshot2.png", "id": "1876173739873412", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393444_1876173743206745_6763138395539482801_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jek6XRZZyMUQ7kNvwEFj5L3&_nc_oc=AdnRvpR0mNRXv5CM_9yspBGh2GbDAwDQZh0kmi-fqOwUfuuUYcCIBJYNQBpiYqiLudw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfttZd6UhLm_FPKflG3nWPe0_0Is1bw3ErtXydLb9uxqew&oe=69A6BE73"}, {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Screenshot5.png", "id": "1157934832465543", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400793_1157934839132209_1607817201009102730_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AVc6IYBALEUQ7kNvwGuh53s&_nc_oc=AdnoSjOwBTfkATN5Kb3iwDdvg7O4xUG7cYiDmoDo22X1JkkUBUJyfQYuUDd6Vm3oruM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvI37uEf69id6p-64VUOiyGa2AQvk3N3R_9gg4WMqnfhw&oe=69A6BF16"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Logo (2560x1440).png", "id": "1355890215582535", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_1355890218915868_2056131209238582864_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3yZ2-SS51ZsQ7kNvwFVtEYj&_nc_oc=AdkeTjIMa9EVXarBZDaEYRBUq3aoxTU5XvGc5Mh4IIzxKvzvCi4sL22YwziCKV3r2-c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft1-H-B3mrokSCHFTrJCuQ3QPixx3F2kjGWFUlusjTqiQ&oe=69A6DDBD"}, "display_name": "Blast Ball Master", "keywords": ["ball", "shoot", "bubble", "match3", "puzzle"], "long_description": "Blast Ball Master is a new vision of the old school Zuma game. \nBlast Ball Master is a puzzle game with a new creative idea.\nBlast Ball Master is interactive and immersive game. Be inside VR.\nBlast Ball Master is a good choice for those who love shooting ball game.\n\nUse 4 boosters: Slow, Freeze, Explosion and Backward Moving! \nUse challenges to get free coins!\nEnjoy colorful effects! \nCool fun music!\nTry different VR hands to get an additional bonus.\nTry Blast Ball Master now!  ", "short_descrip